        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Terra Request you take on the role of a planet manager in training. In your training you'll undergo simulations to prove you are worthy of becoming a planet manager at Terra Request Consulting. Choose your actions carefully as you balance reaching planet development milestones with fulfilling the needs of the planet's three factions or face failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Planet </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures on the surface to increase your planet's stats and build satellites in orbit to multiply the effectiveness of your structures on the surface. Increase your structures' effectiveness even further by acquiring upgrades. Being aware of when to demolish and when to build structures is vital. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/68286524f9d543554f9b02cff592057f.poster.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/68286524f9d543554f9b02cff592057f.webm?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/68286524f9d543554f9b02cff592057f.mp4?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fulfill Requests </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet structure construction quotas and reach planet stat thresholds within the time limit to fulfill requests from the planet's three factions. Earn funds and faction trust with each request that you complete. Don't favor or ignore requests from one side for too long, though, or it's all over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/6f36e0b9948440d62a8e9153b10a01c8.poster.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/6f36e0b9948440d62a8e9153b10a01c8.webm?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/6f36e0b9948440d62a8e9153b10a01c8.mp4?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Milestones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all of your planet's development milestones by building surface structures and satellites to complete the simulation. Be sure to stay on schedule while completing milestones or face penalties. Balancing your resources between completing faction requests and completing development milestones is the key to success.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/ffda63cc4406901e53982efcb03c1bb1.poster.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/ffda63cc4406901e53982efcb03c1bb1.webm?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/ffda63cc4406901e53982efcb03c1bb1.mp4?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Use Special Abilities </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your assistants' powerful abilities to shift the balance of the simulation in your favor. Take advantage of your assistants' abilities to negotiate request requirements and reduce resource costs for surface structures, satellites, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/56528beda187f49815d2dc594a0560d2.poster.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/56528beda187f49815d2dc594a0560d2.webm?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/56528beda187f49815d2dc594a0560d2.mp4?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aim For The Top As You Uncover Secrets </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank up as you gain points from your performance in simulations to take yourself from F rank all the way to A rank. Unlock new assistants and uncover secrets about Terra Request Consulting as you rank up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/ebb3c84fa064b8361eda52e94f591ddf.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Terra Request you take on the role of a planet manager in training. In your training you'll undergo simulations to prove you are worthy of becoming a planet manager at Terra Request Consulting. Choose your actions carefully as you balance reaching planet development milestones with fulfilling the needs of the planet's three factions or face failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Planet </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures on the surface to increase your planet's stats and build satellites in orbit to multiply the effectiveness of your structures on the surface. Increase your structures' effectiveness even further by acquiring upgrades. Being aware of when to demolish and when to build structures is vital. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/68286524f9d543554f9b02cff592057f.poster.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/68286524f9d543554f9b02cff592057f.webm?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/68286524f9d543554f9b02cff592057f.mp4?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fulfill Requests </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet structure construction quotas and reach planet stat thresholds within the time limit to fulfill requests from the planet's three factions. Earn funds and faction trust with each request that you complete. Don't favor or ignore requests from one side for too long, though, or it's all over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/6f36e0b9948440d62a8e9153b10a01c8.poster.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/6f36e0b9948440d62a8e9153b10a01c8.webm?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/6f36e0b9948440d62a8e9153b10a01c8.mp4?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Milestones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all of your planet's development milestones by building surface structures and satellites to complete the simulation. Be sure to stay on schedule while completing milestones or face penalties. Balancing your resources between completing faction requests and completing development milestones is the key to success.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/ffda63cc4406901e53982efcb03c1bb1.poster.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/ffda63cc4406901e53982efcb03c1bb1.webm?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/ffda63cc4406901e53982efcb03c1bb1.mp4?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Use Special Abilities </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your assistants' powerful abilities to shift the balance of the simulation in your favor. Take advantage of your assistants' abilities to negotiate request requirements and reduce resource costs for surface structures, satellites, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/56528beda187f49815d2dc594a0560d2.poster.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/56528beda187f49815d2dc594a0560d2.webm?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/56528beda187f49815d2dc594a0560d2.mp4?t=1778284347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aim For The Top As You Uncover Secrets </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank up as you gain points from your performance in simulations to take yourself from F rank all the way to A rank. Unlock new assistants and uncover secrets about Terra Request Consulting as you rank up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032270/extras/ebb3c84fa064b8361eda52e94f591ddf.avif?t=1778284347\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
